[14.684439, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 7z: streaming files preserve Unicode paths and destination exclusivity \u001b[90m(133.525077ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ zip6: empty, Unicode and incompressible payloads round trip with exact container \u001b[90m(32.520791ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ zip6: mismatched descriptors and expanded size limits reject \u001b[90m(20.556589ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ zip6: streaming files preserve Unicode paths and destination exclusivity \u001b[90m(77.37876ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ compression profiles canonicalize ZIP alias; invalid profiles and size ceilings reject \u001b[90m(1.0228ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 7z to ZIP6 to 7z conversion preserves every byte \u001b[90m(101.702232ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ untrusted member names and oversized dictionaries are rejected before content extraction \u001b[90m(63.041879ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ZIP members identify regular files for independent extractors \u001b[90m(7.549517ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ZIP size fields equal to header magic do not confuse metadata normalization \u001b[90m(1363.102829ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 7z compressed headers rejected before native header decompression \u001b[90m(29.922837ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ multiple members rejected instead of concatenating unrelated data \u001b[90m(16.996511ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ pre-cancelled and live-cancelled file compression leave no destination or staging files \u001b[90m(45.995121ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[14.684458, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ file decoding requires explicit size budget and removes failed output \u001b[90m(27.400312ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[14.68448, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ creation aliases and retained provider wrappers agree across Activity and search metadata \u001b[90m(4.197502ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[14.684487, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ existing native provider fixtures retain original creation dates through real import normalization \u001b[90m(14.00857ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[14.684505, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ source creation ignores import, summary and message dates while Activity marks its separate estimate \u001b[90m(0.506453ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[14.684849, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ retained originals take priority over wrappers and cycles remain bounded \u001b[90m(0.250547ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ original message aliases contribute their own dates and latest branch fallback uses them \u001b[90m(1.115461ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.299086, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ both complete profile conversions preserve content, identity, reading and search across restart \u001b[90m(1379.331601ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ conversion queues Local reads and reading saves while settings remain available \u001b[90m(480.40532ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ prepublication conversion failure retains old durable generation and all acknowledged records \u001b[90m(451.223775ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ postpublication conversion interruption adopts new committed profile on next open \u001b[90m(364.665529ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancellation before publication keeps old active codec and usable archive \u001b[90m(359.09268ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ real process termination at six conversion boundaries preserves one complete generation \u001b[90m(5344.708737ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.710625, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ postcommit deletion failures report cleanup pending across restart and retry safely \u001b[90m(413.683094ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.724299, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ acknowledged service import and reading survive a killed process after its complete temp workspace disappears \u001b[90m(801.351787ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.724503, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ new analytics/search preferences default without rewriting any 3.2 or original 3.3 preference file \u001b[90m(56.754328ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.724577, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all eight local periods and separate source filters survive save/restart without starting a search \u001b[90m(201.786201ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.72464, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ new sidecar saves validate before writes and legacy preference validators accept all old files \u001b[90m(29.628574ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.724847, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ sidecar partial updates retain the other source and reject unsupported schema without deleting data \u001b[90m(12.171799ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.724971, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preview uses browser timezone country and local civil date with the bundled rules \u001b[90m(34.809998ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725065, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preview fails closed without a usable country, browser clock or timezone API \u001b[90m(0.473944ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725159, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Budapest with all en_US locales and an inherited TZ selects Hungary and the OS civil day \u001b[90m(19.934021ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725231, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ country-specific aliases preserve Bratislava, Copenhagen, and Reykjavik \u001b[90m(1.723025ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725295, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ safe historical named aliases are mapped, geographic ambiguity is not guessed \u001b[90m(0.21901ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725344, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ authoritative UTC does not fall back to a stale /etc/timezone or locale \u001b[90m(0.487865ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725418, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ copied localtime file uses named /etc/timezone without reading or comparing tzfile bytes \u001b[90m(0.743911ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ optional timedatectl is last, bounded, and independent of locale/TZ \u001b[90m(0.587154ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725714, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ non-systemd Linux without a recoverable named zone stays unknown and removes TZ for local date \u001b[90m(0.807186ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ missing OS facilities do not throw or invent US \u001b[90m(0.459873ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.725918, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ civil date formatting is Gregorian, zone-specific, and handles DST/year boundaries \u001b[90m(0.955078ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ localtime names are extracted lexically from Linux and macOS layouts \u001b[90m(0.22556ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Windows uses saved native home region and obtains date in the same system query \u001b[90m(0.789419ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.727616, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Windows unsupported macroregions, invalid output, failures and invalid civil days fail conservatively \u001b[90m(1.960243ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ macOS native saved Region takes priority over timezone country and UI language \u001b[90m(0.641717ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ macOS without Electron can query the same native Foundation Region, never timezone-derived country \u001b[90m(0.34522ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ISO country validation does not infer a territory from a language \u001b[90m(0.185129ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Hungary national dates and ordinary adjacent dates \u001b[90m(23.243031ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Western Easter is computed across years, not a fixed-date table \u001b[90m(34.987781ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Orthodox Easter and Julian Christmas use distinct movable rules \u001b[90m(42.147226ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Observed substitute days and year-boundary substitutions \u001b[90m(17.797828ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Regional-only public rules and general observances do not become national \u001b[90m(14.49954ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Requested Christian overlay includes Christmas even when not a national day \u001b[90m(45.572485ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Input validation fails closed and never invents a country \u001b[90m(0.992384ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Evaluation does not mutate the JSON data \u001b[90m(5.126472ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ startup loader uses OS country and civil date with exact bundled rules \u001b[90m(33.836537ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ordinary day, unknown country and invalid date keep normal waves \u001b[90m(23.428399ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ missing/corrupt rule data or native detection failures fail closed \u001b[90m(3.062884ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ production loader resolves bundled rules relative to its module, independent of working directory \u001b[90m(16.081785ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ JSON framing handles every one-byte UTF-8 boundary and unsafe integers \u001b[90m(5.61684ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ streamed ChatGPT records preserve raw alternatives, source indexes, integer IDs and source names \u001b[90m(17.477846ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ streamed conversations wrappers preserve native Grok and converted Meta provider metadata \u001b[90m(17.389464ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ streaming falls back without changing grouped Gemini activity, bare turns, Venice or UTF-16 \u001b[90m(30.074079ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid JSON never emits a conversation before full validation \u001b[90m(20.479353ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ forced ZIP64 streamed member validates CRC before yielding data \u001b[90m(61.37662ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ streaming record, nesting, aggregate and unsupported-adapter limits remain explicit \u001b[90m(18.924225ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancellation interrupts validation and yielding without deadlocking ZIP backpressure \u001b[90m(100.612985ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ZIP canonical duplicate names, directory limits and record counts are rejected \u001b[90m(33.521787ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ input changed during validation is diagnosed before any records are yielded \u001b[90m(16.180563ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Venice forced-ZIP64 file backup retains native IDs and messages \u001b[90m(30.096082ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: openai-polish.json \u001b[90m(19.535586ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: anthropic-polish.json \u001b[90m(1.240098ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: anthropic-project-snapshot.json \u001b[90m(1.159637ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: gemini-polish.json \u001b[90m(1.418026ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: gemini-imagen.json \u001b[90m(0.99579ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: openrouter-polish.json \u001b[90m(1.313749ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: lmstudio-polish.json \u001b[90m(1.375482ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: lmstudio-snapshot.json \u001b[90m(1.547221ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: lmstudio-versions-snapshot.json \u001b[90m(1.401781ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ThreadShelf 1.2.3 native fixture: grok-polish.json \u001b[90m(1.206878ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ChatGPT preserves active branch, original whitespace, analysis, tool turns, empty source slots and r"]
[17.727637, "o", "aw alternatives \u001b[90m(0.713655ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Venice native export includes child/tool records and distinct thinking; converted compatibility \u001b[90m(2.016497ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Meta native transcripts respect fenced speaker labels, unsafe integers, and prior converted format \u001b[90m(19.894781ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Gemini Takeout HTML is inert, retains source card, title, timestamp, and Markdown \u001b[90m(16.073221ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ recursive folder and ZIP reads extensionless AI Studio; identity stable across containers \u001b[90m(37.432489ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid input diagnostics do not abort the remaining import; progress and cancellation \u001b[90m(10.537401ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.727697, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ bounded archive expansion rejects oversized members without extracting files \u001b[90m(24.532909ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
