[17.728307, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ mixed prose, Markdown and already fenced/indented code retain established rendering \u001b[90m(0.356927ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.728388, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ roles, source data, turn identity and existing hiding policy are unchanged \u001b[90m(0.541205ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ size, depth and output expansion limits retain source without exceptions \u001b[90m(51.268935ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ shutdown awaits cancelled operation cleanup, rejects new work, and closes exactly once \u001b[90m(173.694986ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.728545, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ordinary and model searches are cancellable without holding the imports lock \u001b[90m(200.731772ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ shutdown aborts an outstanding model search and waits for its DB cleanup \u001b[90m(189.93262ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a search leaves an independent import running and vice versa \u001b[90m(154.700871ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ shutdown drains queued preference and reading writes \u001b[90m(146.970823ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ saved reading anchors cannot override the explicitly selected source identity \u001b[90m(170.776802ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a broad server listing never copies unselected collections into Local \u001b[90m(263.70075ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid source mode never silently falls back to Local \u001b[90m(185.533658ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ migrating and renaming Local reading keys keeps sparse anchors and Server entries exact \u001b[90m(2.408738ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.728617, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ coalescing duplicates keeps latest position, unions message bookmarks, and remaps recent identities once \u001b[90m(0.51074ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.72882, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ copy bookmarks is opt-in; deleting and clearing Local data remove only intended reading references \u001b[90m(0.580314ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Local backup extraction and restore cannot import or replace another Server namespace \u001b[90m(0.64414ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ manager rename and move retain immutable identities, provenance, bookmarks, offsets and restart durability \u001b[90m(530.190239ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.728897, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ manager copies have independent identities with opt-in bookmarks and exact deletion scope \u001b[90m(404.258367ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729048, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all-matching manager selection honors filters and stale previews reject without partial mutation \u001b[90m(587.98222ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ backup and restore replace Local contents and reading while preserving current Server data and preferences \u001b[90m(753.451596ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ clear all Local data purges automatic recovery copies but preserves models, preferences, external backups and Server reading \u001b[90m(540.0529ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729098, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ acknowledged import is stored compressed and reopens after its entire temporary working directory is discarded \u001b[90m(346.729218ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729141, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ committed manager mutation recovers after interruption before database apply without relying on temporary files \u001b[90m(352.060529ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729177, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ manager recovery reconciles a database change when its reading-state write fails \u001b[90m(433.625518ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729219, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Server-only startup and status do not expand Local archive; Local actions mount once \u001b[90m(384.324175ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729297, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ replaying archive journal does not resurrect a deliberately removed copied bookmark \u001b[90m(357.519314ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729608, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ failed restore publication releases closed handles and remounts the surviving committed archive \u001b[90m(484.475617ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ clearing semantic index is durable, preserves models, and cannot return deleted results from old vectors \u001b[90m(711.975274ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty catalog creation, Unicode renaming, stable IDs and name reuse \u001b[90m(90.676001ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ move and rename preserve IDs, reimports update destination and permit an intentional original-collection copy \u001b[90m(179.665374ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ copy makes independent IDs, preserves provenance and explicitly maps optional bookmark copies \u001b[90m(66.171588ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729684, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ merge coalesces exact provenance/content duplicates and preserves divergent histories \u001b[90m(275.045402ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729889, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all-matching selection is frozen, literal-filtered and independent of a display page \u001b[90m(3458.507385ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ delete collection can move contents first; clear removes catalog and every FTS result \u001b[90m(156.997673ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ prepared records replay with exact IDs/results after restart and reject stale previews \u001b[90m(193.530517ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ manager writes, new catalog entries and applied operation are one transaction \u001b[90m(117.357087ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ v1 catalog is rejected without silently migrating its data \u001b[90m(34.719838ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.729989, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ derived index revision distinguishes independent archives and persists on reopen \u001b[90m(122.333609ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731412, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ prepared exact imports expose a no-write summary preserving stored provenance paths \u001b[90m(116.678761ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ clear removes old operation summaries and remains idempotent after replay \u001b[90m(58.093105ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ explicit Markdown image sources retain their exact URL, independently of suffix \u001b[90m(1.616585ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Markdown image policy rejects local, executable, credential-bearing and malformed sources \u001b[90m(0.339111ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\nMermaid repair tests: PASS\r\n\u001b[32m✔ tests/mermaid-repair.test.mjs \u001b[90m(63.987692ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 2.0 starts an independent archive and preserves old databases and reading bytes \u001b[90m(535.340622ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ discovery distinguishes compatible embeddings, chat-only models and old-server unknown models without sending text \u001b[90m(83.969731ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ chat-only models are rejected before either probe or archive content is sent \u001b[90m(51.893996ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ test uses only synthetic text and old-server unknown models must pass a probe before archive indexing \u001b[90m(112.626848ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ unavailable Ollama returns actionable installation/service status without breaking text search \u001b[90m(283.898407ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ model pull handles split NDJSON, reports progress and verifies downloaded capabilities \u001b[90m(43.262384ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ model pull cancellation aborts an active HTTP stream and preserves ordinary search \u001b[90m(36.113086ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ model discovery reports real sizes and independent model-specific index readiness without embedding text \u001b[90m(107.568287ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ confirmed model deletion uses DELETE at the captured proxy address and accepts an empty success response \u001b[90m(74.290672ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ model deletion rejects invalid or absent models and public URLs before issuing a mutation \u001b[90m(17.193828ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ failed or unconfirmed deletion cannot be reported as a success or mutate local selection/indexes \u001b[90m(36.8186ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling an active model-removal request does not report success \u001b[90m(15.300316ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ application model deletion preserves saved selection, sidecar search preferences, and unrelated archive data \u001b[90m(437.328104ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ model storage sizes omit partial downloads and never follow symlinks \u001b[90m(15.569613ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Windows executable discovery and explicit launch preserve existing Ollama model location \u001b[90m(1.075831ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 1.0.0 settings and reading upgrade in place with the new search-panel default \u001b[90m(200.603252ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ portable root and bin entries are direct relative symlinks and remain valid after moving the full package \u001b[90m(32.29117ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ DEB command resolves to the native /opt payload without a shell wrapper \u001b[90m(17.435794ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ archive walks reject symlinks by default and reject unlisted or retargeted links \u001b[90m(10.094954ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ portable bin entry is mandatory, cannot chain through the root entry, and cannot contain a launcher \u001b[90m(26.207942ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ archive walks never traverse a symlink to a directory \u001b[90m(2.366345ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ dependency-copy file-link dereferencing stays explicit and does not allow directory links \u001b[90m(2.156658ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks reject regular wrappers, dangling links and non-executable payloads \u001b[90m(2.471563ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks reject script payloads, absolute links and links escaping the package \u001b[90m(4.145699ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks require a regular native target, not another symlink \u001b[90m(3.166609ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry-directory guards reject script extensions and extensionless shebang launchers \u001b[90m(17.968705ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional overlay measures actual chrome and removes its inset for another palette \u001b[90m(1.692619ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional overlay follows search, operation and responsive chrome heights \u001b[90m(0.411059ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73146, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ professional overlay clears for Activity and welcome, then restores when a thread returns \u001b[90m(0.32503ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional overlay disconnects observers and rejects queued work after shell replacement \u001b[90m(0.566713ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus overlay measures actual chrome and removes its inset for another palette \u001b[90m(0.168704ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus overlay follows search, operation and responsive chrome heights \u001b[90m(0.216506ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus overlay clears for Activity and welcome, then restores when a thread returns \u001b[90m(0.213731ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus overlay disconnects observers and rejects queued work after shell replacement \u001b[90m(0.209095ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731472, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reader appearance defaults are additive; both old and current appearance readers retain the exact 3.2 key set \u001b[90m(2.414698ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73152, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ malformed or unknown reader preferences are rejected without coercion \u001b[90m(0.919856ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731556, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Revision 4 reader settings upgrade in place without rewriting until save, and new options survive restart \u001b[90m(512.124858ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73158, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 3.2 profile opens with waves off and Outlined right, without rewriting any existing preference file \u001b[90m(178.66719ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731596, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all five choices and the wave toggle survive real save/restart; legacy files and archive content are unchanged \u001b[90m(776.971749ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731617, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ mixed saves stay partitioned, validate before any writes, and drain queued reader settings at shutdown \u001b[90m(429.390713ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731637, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ actual frozen 3.2 validators read/save legacy files after 3.3 saves and leave reader preferences intact \u001b[90m(304.702338ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731657, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ invalid saved reader preferences recover only from a validated backup and preserve corrupt originals \u001b[90m(8.406853ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731692, "o", "\u001b[90m﹣ released 3.2 service -> 3.3 service -> released 3.2 service -> 3.3 preserves settings, saved reading and every durable archive byte \u001b[90m(0.186191ms)\u001b[39m # SKIP\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731726, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ renderer preserves source identity with empty turns and shared thinking/answer indexes \u001b[90m(1.623375ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73175, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all bundled highlight.js grammars are registered \u001b[90m(0.250828ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731786, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reader controls have five complete locale sets \u001b[90m(0.407163ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731814, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ missing primary and backup reading files recover Local reading from the verified normal snapshot \u001b[90m(494.734917ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731852, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ manager clear preserves ambiguous legacy reading ownership instead of guessing Local \u001b[90m(1.533369ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731868, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ late reading callbacks after a collection rename keep authoritative collection metadata \u001b[90m(442.638097ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731889, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ordinary Local history and bookmark clears stay cleared across old journal replay \u001b[90m(437.541531ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731904, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ recovering reading.json.bak does not merge an older Local snapshot over an intentional clear \u001b[90m(372.246198ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731918, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ restore preview rejects checksum-valid malformed reading metadata before publishing a database \u001b[90m(325.799876ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731931, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ lazy Local snapshot recovery preserves Server reading saved after missing-file startup \u001b[90m(356.079116ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.731991, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reading source identity separates Local and canonical server addresses and trusts the persistent key \u001b[90m(2.979258ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732007, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ scoped clear preserves every other source and unidentified legacy entries \u001b[90m(1.987204ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732021, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ recent retention is 200 independently for Local and each server and never evicts unidentified rows \u001b[90m(536.233088ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732034, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ scoped single-record operations reject cross-source keys and preserve key authority \u001b[90m(1.252206ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732091, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ source-scoped deletion survives restart without a reading schema change \u001b[90m(257.235087ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ unscoped clear remains compatible while malformed requested scopes fail without changing state \u001b[90m(0.811973ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732131, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ online images default to auto without rewriting Revision 9 or 3.2 profile files \u001b[90m(52.323094ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732157, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ both online image modes persist across restart in a separate sidecar with old profile bytes unchanged \u001b[90m(57.93702ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732174, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ invalid online image values reject mixed saves before any file changes and shutdown drains accepted saves \u001b[90m(29.8018ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732196, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all five languages cover online-image settings and click/loading controls \u001b[90m(0.961398ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73222, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ resource requests accept only narrow primitive action arguments \u001b[90m(3.528154ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732239, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unknown request bodies are rejected before inspecting their contents \u001b[90m(0.212099ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732258, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ URL identity is canonical without credentials or fragments \u001b[90m(0.177307ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732276, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ opaque contexts authorize rendered Markdown image destinations only \u001b[90m(13.603241ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732298, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ same-identity refetch keeps live tokens while updating allowed sources \u001b[90m(0.775068ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732317, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ active context lookup participates in bounded LRU eviction \u001b[90m(0.740856ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732336, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ trusted display metadata is normalized without modifying archive values \u001b[90m(1.293438ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732363, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ deep irrelevant metadata cannot break ordinary thread registration \u001b[90m(3.041511ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ broad and deep metadata obeys one global traversal admission budget \u001b[90m(58.44875ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732415, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ local and canonical server identities cannot share an image owner \u001b[90m(1.246547ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ settings remain a strict, default-off separate preference \u001b[90m(2.722811ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732429, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ URL and public-address validation blocks credentials, alternate schemes and local ranges \u001b[90m(5.327334ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73245, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ persists original raster bytes and reads them after restart while offline and disabled \u001b[90m(53.749603ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deduplicates simultaneous URL fetches and content bytes while retaining independent ownership \u001b[90m(70.922328ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732464, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ disabled misses render without saving and a disable during fetch prevents late persistence \u001b[90m(12.887157ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732534, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cache-disabled requests still reject private networks, unsafe redirects and invalid image bytes \u001b[90m(10.793378ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ per-owner deletion invalidates its pending save but preserves a simultaneous shared owner \u001b[90m(22.577052ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ clear all aborts pending work, removes saved bytes, and allows later requests \u001b[90m(27.481164ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling one subscriber does not cancel another and close cancels pending requests \u001b[90m(18.587557ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732562, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ bounds concurrency, pending queue, disk capacity and per-image size \u001b[90m(24.160423ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ DNS rejects private and mixed answers; requests pin public addresses and send no private headers \u001b[90m(41.584007ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732599, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ each redirect is validated and pinned, including private DNS and credential redirects \u001b[90m(43.818133ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects SVG, HTML, MIME mismatches, corrupt headers, oversize streams and too many pixels \u001b[90m(25.243053ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732619, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts supported raster types while retaining exact source bytes \u001b[90m(130.522934ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732645, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ damaged saved bytes fail closed; bad index is preserved until explicit clear-all repairs it \u001b[90m(42.992879ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects linked cache directories and linked/hardlinked objects without touching targets \u001b[90m(47.551486ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732673, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cache operations leave unrelated archive and legacy preference bytes unchanged \u001b[90m(30.239549ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ recovers crash orphan objects and temporary files without deleting retained bytes or unrelated files \u001b[90m(36.515954ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732708, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preference change before atomic index publication prevents a pending save \u001b[90m(14.543226ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ metadata entry limits remain bounded independently of stored byte deduplication \u001b[90m(18.436651ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732807, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ DNS and request deadlines terminate stalled work, and shutdown waits for cancellation \u001b[90m(60.91123ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ explicit clear-all repairs a linked index by unlinking only the cache link \u001b[90m(10.989764ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ network failures contain no source URL and allow a later retry \u001b[90m(14.81692ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ APNG animation frames share the aggregate pixel limit even when decoder exposes one page \u001b[90m(48.440825ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732849, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ more than the bridge request cap completes with only four active loads \u001b[90m(11.074452ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelled waiting images never dispatch and do not block a later conversation \u001b[90m(3.050315ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732881, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ task failures and pre-aborted requests release queue capacity without dispatching stale work \u001b[90m(0.921548ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ evidenced bar contract retains order, units, metadata, bounds and input bytes \u001b[90m(3.159799ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.732917, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ pie adapter uses only evidenced nameKey/valueKey, retaining suffix without inventing percentages \u001b[90m(0.591952ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733025, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ additional area and doughnut types require explicit Reader-owned v1 schema \u001b[90m(1.26788ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ scatter keeps unambiguous numeric coordinates and units \u001b[90m(0.651281ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ negative bars and areas include zero; explicit clipping becomes data fallback \u001b[90m(1.065555ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid or semantic feature inputs fall back faithfully \u001b[90m(2.697663ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733041, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ values are never rounded, scaled or coerced \u001b[90m(0.267783ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733119, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unsafe object properties, accessors and cycles never execute \u001b[90m(0.348335ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ input budgets and missing cells stop independently \u001b[90m(1.569014ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ explicit numeric axis units flow to categorical exact values without invented metadata \u001b[90m(0.63751ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733169, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ citation metadata uses exact source identity and explicit recorded tuples without mutation \u001b[90m(1.562103ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ missing metadata, list-only sources, unsafe URLs, conflicts and unknown tuple types do not invent bindings \u001b[90m(0.388716ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733211, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ duplicate source IDs, inherited fields and accessor fields are not read as bindings \u001b[90m(0.2458ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ query-only images and list-only sources never acquire an invented citation or image binding \u001b[90m(0.181002ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733254, "o", "\u001b[90m﹣ rich export: 7z archive stays compatible with Reader and read-only Analytics \u001b[90m(0.712223ms)\u001b[39m # SKIP\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733288, "o", "\u001b[90m﹣ rich export: zip6 archive stays compatible with Reader and read-only Analytics \u001b[90m(0.137317ms)\u001b[39m # SKIP\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ semantic progress paint and text use finite enums; arbitrary CSS remains unsupported \u001b[90m(18.954139ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733309, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ static SVG path/circle illustration survives nested rich layout and retains source \u001b[90m(9.210374ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733347, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ SVG remains inert inside code, mathematics, comments, links and unrelated HTML \u001b[90m(10.136068ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ active, resource-bearing, malformed and oversized SVG remains exact local fallback \u001b[90m(34.176159ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733397, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ SVG expansion accounts for all shape nodes in repeated templates \u001b[90m(3.202944ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ literal grammar supports finite JSON plus quoted/unquoted data keys; never expressions \u001b[90m(2.771314ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.73343, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ observed components, attributes and bare align enum validate without HTML repair \u001b[90m(22.772532ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ finite loops/conditions use own local properties, preserve order, and bind inert primitive text \u001b[90m(4.844216ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733463, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unsupported children on terminal components remain exact source \u001b[90m(1.041308ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ aggregate budgets reject recursive amplification, deep input and excessive literals \u001b[90m(8.854833ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733482, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Markdown tokenizer excludes fenced/inline/indented code, escapes, links and unrelated HTML \u001b[90m(3.092017ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733523, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ mathematics are excluded before rich extraction; typed attribute text is not transformed \u001b[90m(1.103783ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733589, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ rich source indentation around prose and blank lines is not mistaken for top-level code \u001b[90m(0.96893ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ indented template source is protected before loop and binding evaluation \u001b[90m(2.511333ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733633, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ malformed components remain local; invalid complete span cannot consume later siblings \u001b[90m(1.010322ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ replacement records use fresh unspoofable markers and retain surrounding specifications \u001b[90m(4.54733ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733661, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ legacy GenUI wrappers are separate literal adapters, never a fenced JSON heuristic \u001b[90m(7.690764ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ hostile unclosed tag soup fails the linear preflight before Markdown tokenization \u001b[90m(1.48062ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.733728, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ safe links are explicit and scheme restricted \u001b[90m(0.198328ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ runtime branding writes and verifies complete bytes over a truncated destination \u001b[90m(76.630847ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.734127, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ runtime branding rejects a silently truncated write and retains its good source \u001b[90m(33.409323ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ runtime branding propagates a flush failure without accepting or removing its source \u001b[90m(41.095311ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Node channels select numerically newest supported LTS or non-LTS stable Current \u001b[90m(1.96498ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Electron latest means the highest exact stable version, excluding draft and prerelease metadata \u001b[90m(0.204508ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ exact versions reject mutable tags, ranges, prereleases and injected paths \u001b[90m(0.286812ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ one selected Electron version overrides the lockfile baseline without mutating it \u001b[90m(0.3387ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ metadata failure is explicit and never silently reuses a cached latest version \u001b[90m(1.077533ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.734196, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ invalid HTTP metadata cannot be accepted as a current release \u001b[90m(0.320053ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Node bootstrap parser agrees with the JSON resolver for compact or formatted official metadata \u001b[90m(12.104317ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Bash action conflicts and prereleases are rejected before setup \u001b[90m(21.834098ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.734228, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Bash latest refuses failed online resolution even when a system Node is available \u001b[90m(34.655506ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Bash rejects corrupt downloaded runtime bytes before using any installed Node \u001b[90m(35.373813ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.734272, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ conversion waits for aborted Ollama indexing cleanup before closing its database \u001b[90m(467.240135ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ manager mutations serialize after a successful Ollama search durable checkpoint \u001b[90m(300.24944ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.788298, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ compact text cache preserves original scoring, Unicode, literal phrases and fuzzy semantics \u001b[90m(328.916011ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ periods use original conversation creation, exclude undated/future records and prefilter compressed text \u001b[90m(350.942438ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[17.788456, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ period cutoffs clamp calendar months and reject arbitrary custom inputs \u001b[90m(0.467253ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ incremental indexing reuses unchanged conversations, survives cancellation and repairs damaged SQLite \u001b[90m(364.01562ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[18.644632, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ranked pagination reuses frozen results, clamps pages and invalidates on revision or query changes \u001b[90m(890.73334ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[18.796925, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ title/list sessions preserve fullbody literal matching and metadata ordering without rescans \u001b[90m(750.284598ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[18.962882, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ fast searches publish no partials; slow searches append stable unique batches and abort removes spill files \u001b[90m(178.427587ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[19.145596, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ simultaneous searches keep progress IDs separate and cancelling one does not cancel the other \u001b[90m(104.999135ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[19.78433, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ text blocks preserve large messages exactly and clearing index removes derived copies \u001b[90m(231.33568ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.549236, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cancelled mid-build preserves the last committed text generation and explicit Prepare repairs corrupt blocks \u001b[90m(1236.748017ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.661715, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ranked sessions retain the existing 1000-result cap and cancelled cached pages reject \u001b[90m(137.052746ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.677307, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ slow no-match searches still activate provisional state after the threshold \u001b[90m(89.770137ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687211, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ search preferences keep Local and Server scopes separate and reject unsupported stored values \u001b[90m(1.870658ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ partial batches keep existing order, deduplicate retries, and retain distinct passages in one turn \u001b[90m(0.228254ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ estimated progress is omitted without a denominator and cannot claim completion during ranking \u001b[90m(0.283587ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687246, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ranked search returns relevant exact source turns, field filters and phrase exclusions \u001b[90m(23.376226ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ exact search preserves literal substring semantics and fuzzy search repairs transpositions \u001b[90m(18.293691ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ semantic mode never starts model downloading without explicit setup \u001b[90m(11.37274ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ assistant role alias works for text, fuzzy and semantic filters without changing source anchors \u001b[90m(64.683295ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687376, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ semantic vectors persist, changed content invalidates them, unchanged chunks are reused \u001b[90m(80.751596ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687509, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ indexing cancellation preserves text search and allows safe resume \u001b[90m(37.983984ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687523, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ model setup failures give useful status without losing ordinary search \u001b[90m(18.205402ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ long message chunks preserve the end and use real source turn identifiers \u001b[90m(55.121579ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687567, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Ollama uses installed models and modern embed endpoint, persists digest and reindexes when changed \u001b[90m(94.330498ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Ollama legacy embedding API fallback and abort contract \u001b[90m(51.718933ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ real archive FTS candidates preserve accent-insensitive ranking and sparse turn indexes \u001b[90m(102.362483ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.6876, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ synthetic severity cards retain labels, value, structured rows, and safe source links \u001b[90m(20.810106ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ordinary security Markdown and unavailable visualization references are preserved unchanged \u001b[90m(8.49176ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ severity card inputs cannot add script, events, or unsafe source links \u001b[90m(6.469605ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687765, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ streaming text search visits beyond 20,000 candidates and retains exact totals and pages \u001b[90m(1549.994638ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ global text ranking is independent of source segment/order with phrase exclusions and filters \u001b[90m(11.855558ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ semantic vectors stay in bounded packs and selected results alone hydrate text \u001b[90m(227.861543ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ both vector compression conversions preserve index identity, scores and model generation \u001b[90m(231.409942ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelled rebuild retains the complete previous generation and clears pending refs \u001b[90m(217.448482ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ corrupt semantic pack falls back to text and reports the checksum failure \u001b[90m(41.476834ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ hybrid global reciprocal-rank fusion remains exact beyond requested window \u001b[90m(126.862506ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ search cancellation always removes owned spill files \u001b[90m(20.330082ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ vector conversion yields between blocks so cancellation can interrupt staging \u001b[90m(142.719542ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ metadata-only archive and semantic index preserve sparse anchors and content through reads \u001b[90m(111.197883ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ bounded search workspace reports exhaustion and remains usable after cleanup \u001b[90m(152.924583ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ an import changing the archive during a yielded query discards mixed-revision results \u001b[90m(38.127034ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687782, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ text fallback from a concurrent semantic query cannot terminate an active index worker \u001b[90m(51.095062ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687809, "o", "\u001b[90m﹣ real multilingual model and automatic portable fallback retrieve meaning with all network requests blocked \u001b[90m(1.024483ms)\u001b[39m # SKIP\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Insights fetches exactly the stock summary endpoint and preserves passage and turn units \u001b[90m(38.033389ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687825, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selected scope and complete longest-thread identities are preserved; refresh reads current summaries \u001b[90m(16.985314ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687832, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ empty archives are valid and absent optional role aggregates remain unavailable \u001b[90m(16.848309ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687839, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ malformed counts, identities, dates and scopes reject rather than display fabricated analytics \u001b[90m(44.646991ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687847, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ missing endpoint, authentication and server failures stay errors without a scan fallback \u001b[90m(26.81447ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.68789, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ invalid collection selections and already cancelled requests never contact the server \u001b[90m(1.272016ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling an in-flight summary request rejects and retry performs one fresh summary fetch \u001b[90m(7.029158ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a transport that ignores cancellation cannot publish an obsolete response after its scope was left \u001b[90m(1.423244ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ stock server text search retrieves all 137 matching messages over real pages, including identical timestamps \u001b[90m(56.521553ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687897, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ lookahead across source boundaries is never lost and duplicate filenames retain complete identities \u001b[90m(28.694762ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687903, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ role and provider filters apply while scanning all messages with the original indices \u001b[90m(6.877679ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.687956, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ only bounded page excerpts are retained and an evicted earlier page is re-read correctly \u001b[90m(17.906262ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688095, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a failed later thread does not silently truncate the result total and retry does not skip a page \u001b[90m(16.045824ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancellation during a page read rewinds its cursor; retry resumes without losing the first match \u001b[90m(16.990908ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ only an actual unsupported-endpoint 404 permits fallback; server and authentication errors propagate \u001b[90m(8.923266ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688128, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ legacy Meaning remains the real server-ranked top50 and explains that further pagination requires server support \u001b[90m(7.559637ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ the optional extension pages both text and semantic results past50, aggregating only valid max50 requests \u001b[90m(23.176942ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ an expired extension cursor gives an actionable retry instead of duplicate top50 results \u001b[90m(24.850031ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ sessions are bound to source, query, filters, and page size; evicted sessions explicitly restart \u001b[90m(68.83512ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688151, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ApplicationService server paging never imports conversations or writes search hits into the Local archive \u001b[90m(207.259552ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688172, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a direct request past the known final page returns that final page without replaying the first search \u001b[90m(22.601283ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ keyword and semantic searches honor actual server maximum despite UI limit 1000 \u001b[90m(49.607634ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688205, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ all transmitted result limits are finite integers from 1 to 50 \u001b[90m(57.891832ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ role aliases filter on server before its bounded result set and retain full identities \u001b[90m(13.286122ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ provider post-filter does not overfetch and honestly reports the bounded scope \u001b[90m(6.776448ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688213, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ server title filtering uses summaries only and never searches conversation contents \u001b[90m(5.401126ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty queries avoid requests; unsupported local modes cannot silently become server keyword search \u001b[90m(0.777851ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ concurrent Local reads, status and mutation wait for journal recovery before exposing the archive \u001b[90m(453.046375ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.68822, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reads and status wait through restore without mounting twice or closing the restored session \u001b[90m(447.671639ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688241, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Local waiters recover the previous durable archive when restore publication fails \u001b[90m(423.322286ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ shutdown waits for restore and already accepted Local readers before closing their handles \u001b[90m(404.885385ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688262, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ stale prepared mutations are rejected before durable append, including unchanged imports \u001b[90m(293.291296ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.68828, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Local mount reconciliation preserves a Server reading write already queued ahead of it \u001b[90m(260.2746ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[20.688287, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a Database Manager status read started before restore retries after the archive changes \u001b[90m(373.945517ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.448553, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ server listing hides empty collections; search retains string index zero and full identity \u001b[90m(52.209113ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ selective server copy is complete, repeatable, independent, and uses GET only \u001b[90m(4265.618219ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.575744, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ empty server selection cannot import unintended collections \u001b[90m(126.827024ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.661072, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preferences and reading use one root with mode-separated identities and serialized writes \u001b[90m(85.482698ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.731393, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ directory fallback keeps configured custom location and finds last used \u001b[90m(70.256404ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.795964, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ corrupted settings recover previous valid snapshot, unsupported schema is preserved \u001b[90m(64.664927ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807277, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ source switch width defaults to equal and validates only the three offered choices \u001b[90m(1.695444ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807344, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ legacy interface preferences gain equal source widths without changing saved files or other preferences \u001b[90m(209.082678ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ all width preferences persist across actual service restarts and invalid saves preserve the previous choice \u001b[90m(320.474961ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807473, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ invalid stored width retains established recovery behavior and preserves the corrupt file \u001b[90m(7.956415ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.80752, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ journal byte budget is reconstructed on reopen and reset only by durable checkpoint \u001b[90m(262.099786ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807556, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ conversion cleanup failure commits new codec, reports pending work, and later compaction retries \u001b[90m(249.252965ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807572, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ compaction preserves unowned object files and foreign recovery marker versions \u001b[90m(166.625514ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ semantic object conversion, unopened metadata and ZIP64 backup restore preserve model revision \u001b[90m(597.746287ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807622, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ storage refuses symlinked owned directories and does not reclaim files through them \u001b[90m(141.333925ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ordinary confirmed restore repairs a damaged same-name immutable object after preserving the original \u001b[90m(291.239596ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.807643, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Win32 writable-flush rule allows clean initialization, journal, backup, restore and recovery preservation \u001b[90m(434.524752ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ regular-file EPERM on a writable snapshot handle aborts publication and retains durable records \u001b[90m(169.024404ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[21.80769, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ regular-file EPERM on a writable journal handle cannot acknowledge or apply a mutation \u001b[90m(182.5856ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ corrected flush retries the profile left by the original fresh-start failure without clearing settings \u001b[90m(204.04907ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[23.723716, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 7z snapshot and committed records recover after all temporary files disappear \u001b[90m(204.103882ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ uncommitted partial record is ignored; durable record before apply is recovered \u001b[90m(225.183089ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ failed application is poisoned and committed operation retries from the snapshot \u001b[90m(128.509352ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ corrupt current manifest fails explicitly without selecting an older generation \u001b[90m(175.260918ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ missing or corrupt committed recovery record cannot silently drop changes \u001b[90m(137.982727ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ compressed snapshot corruption fails before the archive opens \u001b[90m(117.95522ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ version 2 ignores and preserves legacy catalog and WAL files \u001b[90m(190.119348ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ second writer cannot acquire the same profile \u001b[90m(122.195127ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ checkpoint publication failures preserve acknowledged operations \u001b[90m(751.043382ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ concurrent commits serialize and callbacks observe committed sequence \u001b[90m(369.614784ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ backup validates, restores in a new epoch and durably marks Local reading replacement \u001b[90m(206.452615ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ vector snapshots stay compressed until requested and survive archive checkpoint without vector open \u001b[90m(196.029685ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ compaction retains only current snapshot and acknowledged state while preserving unknown files \u001b[90m(219.518371ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ temporary cleanup ignores lookalike and other-profile directories \u001b[90m(44.300328ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ durable recovery head detects deletion of the last acknowledged operation \u001b[90m(64.196627ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ compressed committed record corruption is explicit \u001b[90m(77.763501ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ interrupted first snapshot retries clean v2 initialization and preserves legacy data \u001b[90m(99.388335ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ missing current manifest after compaction cannot silently create an empty archive \u001b[90m(130.360435ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ streamed redo preserves astral Unicode at chunk boundaries and payloads beyond previous 64 MiB cap \u001b[90m(2341.963311ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.009454, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ in-app recovery stages external backup without modifying corrupt original, preserves it on confirmed install \u001b[90m(286.178786ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.245981, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ forged ZIP manifest size cannot bypass bounded metadata expansion \u001b[90m(236.555129ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.317876, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ backup cancellation leaves an existing external file intact \u001b[90m(71.129411ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.426933, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ verification validates committed journal bytes before reporting health \u001b[90m(109.543623ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.82399, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ real process termination recovers committed journal/snapshot and stale writer lease \u001b[90m(396.970169ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.840864, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ theme choices contain complete distinct light/dark color maps and safe defaults \u001b[90m(3.808667ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Revision 8 preserves all eighteen existing palette entries and every code theme \u001b[90m(0.548897ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ custom palettes maintain readable primary UI and code token contrast in both color modes \u001b[90m(4.124653ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.840904, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Platinum Plus follows Platinum, inherits Professional tokens exactly, and preserves their neutral colors \u001b[90m(0.512462ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional saves and restores at native startup without changing archive data or independent preferences \u001b[90m(473.164601ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus saves and restores at native startup without changing archive data or independent preferences \u001b[90m(334.414768ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ OLED uses neutral surfaces and readable semantic states in both modes \u001b[90m(0.937873ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 1.1.0 profiles gain independent appearance without modifying legacy settings, reading or archive contents \u001b[90m(246.293932ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841032, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ mixed preference writes remain partitioned and invalid themes cannot partially change settings \u001b[90m(133.548187ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ revision 5 palettes and code schemes survive independent saves and a real service restart \u001b[90m(576.282027ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 3.1.0 glass palettes persist independently across restarts without changing archive or unrelated preferences \u001b[90m(308.183843ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ view summaries remove only status turns by stable identity without modifying source \u001b[90m(2.426555ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ truncated JSON excerpts are not shown before their original turn is verified \u001b[90m(0.463639ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ source reads are bounded, deduplicated and cache only compact visibility metadata \u001b[90m(10.813137ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ source invalidation discards queued and stale async results without writing state \u001b[90m(1.74621ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty and search-status-only ChatGPT thoughts are hidden in the view \u001b[90m(1.77261ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841049, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ substantive, mixed, unknown and malformed thoughts remain readable \u001b[90m(0.374244ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841053, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ user, tool, system and literal code examples are never hidden \u001b[90m(0.21907ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841069, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ display filtering preserves original turn indexes, IDs, text and array contents \u001b[90m(0.94316ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841133, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ timeline pointer target adds eight CSS pixels without moving bucket boundaries \u001b[90m(1.14178ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841177, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ padded timeline hit area never steals surrounding links or disclosure controls \u001b[90m(0.499453ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reader native Windows entry accepts equivalent Chromium percent-encoding without case/path relaxation \u001b[90m(2.417912ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reader rejects foreign URLs, hosts, queries and encoded path separators; only existing fragment support is retained \u001b[90m(0.409226ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reader IPC requires the exact owning WebContents and actual main frame even with equivalent entry encoding \u001b[90m(0.226401ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reader POSIX file entries preserve case, literal percent signs and existing fragments \u001b[90m(0.173031ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 3.0 opens an actual released-2.0 synthetic profile without reimport or changes to reader data \u001b[90m(255.481219ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841214, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ wave preference keeps packaged source selection, motion restrictions and cleanup independent \u001b[90m(3.546532ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a stale interrupted play cannot remove a video resumed after rapid visibility changes \u001b[90m(1.313228ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ welcome video requires both switches and explicit welcome state; empty/loading readers stay still \u001b[90m(0.897222ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ holiday replacement is limited to welcome in both themes, and resets immediately for reading \u001b[90m(0.933446ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841226, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unknown holiday status, disabled holiday option and ordinary dates use normal welcome waves \u001b[90m(1.128159ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ welcome fireworks obey motion, visibility and active-workspace lifetimes \u001b[90m(1.643515ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841287, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ failed welcome fireworks do not poison normal reading video, and stale errors cannot release its replacement \u001b[90m(0.866796ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841319, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ embedded preview media revokes each object URL when welcome/read mode switches or closes \u001b[90m(2.580216ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional conversation moves the single existing video behind the header without resetting playback \u001b[90m(0.883271ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional keeps normal welcome and holiday video inside Reader; standalone Reader safely retains its host \u001b[90m(0.502287ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional host changes tolerate stale play rejection in older browsers and keep real failures observable \u001b[90m(0.56451ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional parent marker and media are cleaned up on hidden theme changes, motion, workspace changes and destruction \u001b[90m(0.975229ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ professional palette changes reuse one embedded source URL until final release \u001b[90m(1.348717ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus conversation moves the single existing video behind the header without resetting playback \u001b[90m(0.567645ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus keeps normal welcome and holiday video inside Reader; standalone Reader safely retains its host \u001b[90m(0.511821ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841356, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus host changes tolerate stale play rejection in older browsers and keep real failures observable \u001b[90m(0.460914ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus parent marker and media are cleaned up on hidden theme changes, motion, workspace changes and destruction \u001b[90m(0.601636ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ platinum-plus palette changes reuse one embedded source URL until final release \u001b[90m(0.824472ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841398, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ real archive worker drains IPC work and returns a closing error after shutdown \u001b[90m(330.371413ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[24.841923, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ tests 588\u001b[39m\r\n"]
