[433.279888, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ A stack exposes every plotted group, including zero, and indents the exact Other categories \u001b[90m(10.824999ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Every category dot exactly matches its plotted stack color and its legend dot \u001b[90m(3.39864ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[433.280068, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ The last45 timeline bars and first ranked bars retain original exact table evidence indices \u001b[90m(14.425515ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Explicit zero remains zero while missing, non-finite and contradictory group counts remain unavailable \u001b[90m(0.631091ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[433.280306, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Character measurements keep category counts in their own Content-segments unit \u001b[90m(4.596855ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Non-category aggregate bars show only their measured value and matching dot \u001b[90m(0.47141ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Composition bars preserve the established semantic role colors and measure dots match them \u001b[90m(1.505273ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Tooltip labels and periods are escaped and private evidence bodies never enter chart markup \u001b[90m(4.146727ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Native focusable bar buttons expose all category counts and reference a real tooltip \u001b[90m(0.751953ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Tooltip geometry stays bounded for narrow/large plots and horizontal lists near the viewport bottom \u001b[90m(0.569077ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Delegated hover listeners install once and clean up without changing data or invoking evidence \u001b[90m(0.705683ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Focus and keyboard navigation reveal the correct bar, scroll details, and dismiss without replacing native evidence activation \u001b[90m(2.034125ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ New hover text uses the existing five locale catalog and all legacy bars import the shared helper \u001b[90m(13.519906ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
