[434.125101, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ actual preload/main dispatch completes source capture, positional history calls, cleanup and disconnected-source owned reindex \u001b[90m(2621.600042ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ actual IPC sender and external route reject untrusted calls and source-supplied URL schemes \u001b[90m(26.792527ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ actual preload update subscriptions preserve inert serialization and dispose listeners \u001b[90m(1.568002ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ retained evidence IPC resolves removed older records after original disconnection with exact paging, filters and bounded excerpts \u001b[90m(2911.07935ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137272, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ full Markdown index uses real CommonMark/GFM structure tokens and literal retained fences \u001b[90m(27.212341ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137452, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ missing text unavailable, actual empty zero, Unicode code points and trace/summary separate \u001b[90m(24.086801ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ R7 quantiles, weighted quantiles and model length boxes have independent expected values \u001b[90m(5.345956ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ concentration reconciles observed totals and membership perspective remains explicit \u001b[90m(5.114416ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ declared code body size, unspecified and unclosed fence observations are retained \u001b[90m(3.79039ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ NFC whitespace matching does not merge distinct prompt event identities \u001b[90m(2.328949ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ attachment scoped metadata dedupes mirrors; recorded zero bytes valid; dimensions strict positive \u001b[90m(2.438044ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137677, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ weekday-hour object anchor counts mixed-category object exactly once; day precision excluded; epoch zero valid \u001b[90m(18.795859ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ seasonality uses actual leap-year calendar denominator and includes zero-count bounded periods \u001b[90m(5.75468ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137752, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ active-day runs, intervening empty days and archive censoring match calendar dates \u001b[90m(4.768154ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ continuation uses first observed week and excludes insufficient followup from denominator \u001b[90m(5.548886ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137782, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reply ordinals and intervals establish original adjacency before record filtering \u001b[90m(6.732233ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.137807, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ recorded intervals preserve ties and reversed timestamps, exclude date-only endpoints \u001b[90m(3.547545ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138029, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ paired lens requires recorded parent/turn association rather than order or logical id \u001b[90m(3.317638ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ original trace and summary relationships separate ratio of sums from per-conversation ratios \u001b[90m(1.551869ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ same-object trace/final volume lens is available and not category-split \u001b[90m(1.046937ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ feature presence, co-occurrence and parser structures use full text; repeated blocks do not multiply presence \u001b[90m(2.186965ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ reference channel URL normalization cross-channel dedupe and unlinked markers preserve numerical tables \u001b[90m(2.849152ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ matrix top axes aggregate explicit Other without losing qualifying presence population \u001b[90m(1.669485ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138071, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ ECDF evidence is lazy cumulative population and numerical table remains exact \u001b[90m(1.053588ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138182, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ valid full-text index survives excerpts; absent index needs rebuild and is not measured as short text \u001b[90m(2.336671ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ explicit conversation aliases preserve original adjacency and ordinal gaps \u001b[90m(1.570056ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
