[434.138543, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 20/21 all-retained topology and versions remain distinct from selected text filters \u001b[90m(1.190514ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 20/21 missing parents and cycles produce unavailable depth rather than fabricated factors \u001b[90m(1.046988ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138606, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 22 distinct scoped calls/outputs reconcile mirrors and unmatched output populations \u001b[90m(1.515814ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 22 explicitly selected call-only association differs from all-retained conversation context \u001b[90m(1.694554ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138648, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 23 partitions verified zero/source/recap durations and excludes unverified generic timing \u001b[90m(1.236323ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
