[434.138716, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 23 verified concurrency merges same-task spans and does not count zero-length/tied intervals \u001b[90m(1.332668ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138757, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 24 generic verified flag cannot establish usage semantics; audited same-object fields pair without overlap sums \u001b[90m(2.101736ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138788, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 24 context occupancy requires same supplied positive limit; explicit zero stays observed \u001b[90m(3.652363ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.138853, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 25 aligned categories share units and show signed deltas with unavailable relative zero baseline \u001b[90m(6.651212ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 26 Type-7 quantiles and fixed-bin/ECDF overlays reconcile independent sample populations \u001b[90m(1.697808ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.13942, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 27 exact content intersections remain separate from scoped request/conversation identity \u001b[90m(11.777686ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 28 every additive component including Unknown reconciles to aggregate B−A \u001b[90m(1.43342ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 29 observability counts record/object eligibility, not existential conversation capability \u001b[90m(0.943561ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 30 diagnostics count records only when linked and keep unlinked source limitations at conversation level \u001b[90m(2.341738ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 31 coverage change exposes text absence alongside value change without zero imputation \u001b[90m(1.465999ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 32 disabled history cannot reconstruct unretained snapshots; enabled actual hash/identity/path diffs work \u001b[90m(2.932988ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ new measurements reject stale legacy text analysis and excerpt fallback while valid complete index survives excerpts \u001b[90m(5.050801ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ all required 19–32 families provide scalar exact rows and complete measurement contracts \u001b[90m(2.089438ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 22 reused call join IDs preserve distinct call events and disclose ambiguous matching outputs \u001b[90m(0.67716ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 23 independently scoped source items in one enclosing message retain each duration \u001b[90m(0.608728ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 29 canonical provider aliases retain source provenance and usage audits match canonical provider \u001b[90m(3.27851ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 29 conversation date basis cannot manufacture original clock timestamp availability \u001b[90m(1.218927ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 27 partial filtered prompt objects cannot reuse full-object prompt digests \u001b[90m(5.895051ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 32 service-owned metadata diffs produce exact counts without transferring private paths or full text \u001b[90m(2.003633ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 32 capability property order alone cannot manufacture a capture change \u001b[90m(0.92274ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 19/20 topology aliases preserve nodes without doubling object segments or native activity \u001b[90m(0.832905ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ actual wrapper implements all 32 chart families with complete contracts and exact report rows \u001b[90m(104.44772ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ actual histogram/R7/ECDF populations and lazy evidence match independently known response lengths \u001b[90m(13.894265ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ comparison remains unavailable until two explicitly applied compatible selections and reconciles exact deltas \u001b[90m(20.087259ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ actual default Explorer exports exclude original prompt wording, URLs, filenames and sensitive declarations \u001b[90m(122.014229ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ captured-source history uses only actual immutable capture pairs and stays unavailable by default \u001b[90m(8.484583ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 13 complete density bins survive more than 40 rows and an extreme unbounded outlier axis \u001b[90m(58.78552ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 13 density bin positions depend on ordinal axis keys and all cells retain source evidence row indices \u001b[90m(26.753725ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 13/14 full 16×16 density rendering retains all 256 exact cells and original indices \u001b[90m(104.992546ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 13/14 use one explicit bounded axis column and 16 equal bin columns inside a density-specific viewport \u001b[90m(100.074602ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Density k/M labels preserve independently expected exact finite/unbounded header and cell ranges \u001b[90m(64.51946ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 14 trace and summary density selectors preserve their original mixed-table indices \u001b[90m(3.5644ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 15 prevalence renders every feature for 12 selected model axes rather than a 40-row prefix \u001b[90m(17.223476ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 15 model axis limits keep complete feature rows for each chosen model \u001b[90m(12.738212ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 15 unavailable prevalence remains a grey dash while an observed zero is a numeric 0% \u001b[90m(10.411267ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 16 upper-triangle co-occurrence mirrors identical evidence indices over a shared source/target axis union \u001b[90m(3.114221ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 16 Jaccard uses a fixed "]
[434.139526, "o", "0–1 scale and never converts unknown unions into zero overlap \u001b[90m(3.023696ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Density fitting leaves categorical matrix labels, exact values, and mirrored evidence rows unchanged \u001b[90m(75.393609ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 18 horizontal structure bars expose the structure name, exact count, and source evidence index \u001b[90m(2.924396ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 17 bounded concentration sampling includes the final cumulative observation and domain labels \u001b[90m(30.684111ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Concentration sampling is deterministic, keeps both endpoints and never rewrites numerical rows \u001b[90m(2.526807ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Bin/structure grids hide unused row limits and bounded co-occurrence offers only supported limits \u001b[90m(8.904858ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ 16 explicitly discloses original/retained/Other label populations rather than reporting only plotted axes \u001b[90m(2.914111ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Document-scoped focus/pointer hover stays visible during in-view scroll and hides when its source leaves the viewport \u001b[90m(3.069334ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ECDF uses actual threshold/fraction, excluding histogram and unrelated populations \u001b[90m(6.287603ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Unavailable scatter values are absent marks while an explicitly observed zero is valid \u001b[90m(0.88917ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Box plot renders genuine quartiles and no invented zero for a missing group \u001b[90m(0.901818ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Retained parent graph draws actual edges, alternatives and no fabricated category ladder \u001b[90m(3.997703ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Lifecycle lanes use recorded interval endpoints to scale bar widths \u001b[90m(0.799685ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reply position bands render Q1/Q3 and signed shifts remain within axes \u001b[90m(1.330495ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Hourly heatmap retains all 168 cells despite a bounded mark preference \u001b[90m(4.432649ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ All Explorer families, schema columns, definitions and controls have five translated catalogs \u001b[90m(133.233216ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Preview bridge persists presets separately, history disabled by default and selected active capture preserved \u001b[90m(676.519224ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Source text is escaped and only trusted evidence commands can be rendered in Explorer tables \u001b[90m(1.126127ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Graph styles avoid filled axis triangles and support keyboard evidence activation \u001b[90m(3.30523ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.139553, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unknown saved filter keys are retained and explicitly report a partial selection \u001b[90m(17.21679ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ legacy zero epoch original dates and count meanings remain available \u001b[90m(1.233418ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ strict JSON bytes decode UTF-8/16/32 BOM and unmarked encodings without replacing text \u001b[90m(3.540375ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ direct JSON is read-only, fingerprinted and leaves message dates independent \u001b[90m(38.349972ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ mixed-provider arrays and unsupported neighbors dispatch independently \u001b[90m(17.254776ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140019, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ extracted nested directory includes extensionless AI Studio input \u001b[90m(28.905487ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140039, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ HTML JSON scripts and jsonData literals are data and never executed \u001b[90m(34.411769ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140149, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ static HTML preserves visible roles and removes inert active content \u001b[90m(14.989068ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ZIP64 imports extensionless documents without extracting any files \u001b[90m(46.882012ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ZIP path traversal and profile containers are refused \u001b[90m(36.350158ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Reader profiles, descendant exports and explicit settings are excluded \u001b[90m(7.019101ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ file and ancestor symlinks cannot become sources \u001b[90m(8.816534ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140158, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ UTF-8 streaming wrappers retain valid mixed provider records and reject malformed tails \u001b[90m(40.955958ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140183, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ changed source files contribute no partially normalized conversations \u001b[90m(22.002911ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.14023, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ same-size source edits with unchanged handle timestamps discard parsed records \u001b[90m(13.984486ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ size, JSON depth and cancellation limits are enforced \u001b[90m(47.185994ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
