[434.140254, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ source duplicates across independent files reconcile without text-similarity deletion \u001b[90m(43.956664ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140266, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ raw Meta labeled transcripts retain source speaker boundaries and unknown model \u001b[90m(11.366085ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140277, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Gemini Takeout cards preserve explicit event dates, invisible model remains unknown \u001b[90m(17.393176ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140363, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ independent logical/object/segment counts and role distinctions \u001b[90m(19.128331ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ same mixed collection is additive for compatible segments and preserves provider/model separation \u001b[90m(7.524276ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.140894, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ message model filtering genuinely excludes unmatched messages; conversation model filter is separate \u001b[90m(2.88681ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ branch/version scope and memberships preserve counting policies \u001b[90m(12.067182ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ dedup uses explicit identity, preserves repeated prompts and separate source namespaces \u001b[90m(6.489517ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ epoch zero valid; date boundaries, undated behavior and explicit conversation date basis \u001b[90m(14.086864ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ day-only precision preserves original calendar day and excludes hour metric \u001b[90m(3.348765ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ IANA timezones account for DST and equal calendar-length previous periods \u001b[90m(4.894153ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Unicode multilingual segmentation, fences, declared code language, links, tables, citations \u001b[90m(0.693535ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ usage scopes, fields and source-object repetition never invent consumption \u001b[90m(2.347136ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ ratio applies only paired exported traces; missing thinking is unavailable \u001b[90m(0.86936ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ reports share applied tables, privacy default and opt-in escaped evidence \u001b[90m(30.865796ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ CSV formula injection rejects leading controls and respects literal numeric values \u001b[90m(0.154202ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ unsupported empty neighbors, unknown categories and empty denominator remain honest \u001b[90m(1.660827ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ precomputed full-text metrics survive compact boolean or string excerpt flags \u001b[90m(7.978771ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ aggregate export removes source paths; HTML headings follow all five locales \u001b[90m(22.680708ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ saved virtual groups, explicit model families and numeric recap metadata preserve scope \u001b[90m(3.185349ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary-only reasoning stays distinct from observed traces and paired ratios \u001b[90m(0.881618ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ repeated object metadata does not duplicate indicators, attachments, outputs or usage \u001b[90m(0.967047ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ display aliases never merge data or leak into aggregate report filters; empty virtual groups stay empty \u001b[90m(9.737973ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ applied excerpt search gives matching GUI and report populations beyond the 8k boundary \u001b[90m(2.279775ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ report scaffold translates visible headings, subtitle, unavailable cells and previous-period prose directly \u001b[90m(11.771956ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ aggregate serializers omit every nested evidence ID list without changing numerical cells \u001b[90m(8.147245ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ portable entry is a relative symlink and remains valid after moving the full package \u001b[90m(26.631064ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ DEB command resolves to the native /opt payload without a shell wrapper \u001b[90m(4.795526ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ archive walks reject symlinks by default and reject unlisted or retargeted links \u001b[90m(5.70822ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ archive walks never traverse a symlink to a directory \u001b[90m(4.612559ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ dependency-copy file-link dereferencing stays explicit and does not allow directory links \u001b[90m(4.352748ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks reject regular wrappers, dangling links and non-executable payloads \u001b[90m(4.659962ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks reject script payloads, absolute links and links escaping the package \u001b[90m(6.193667ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry checks require a regular native target, not another symlink \u001b[90m(4.87814ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ entry-directory guards reject script extensions and extensionless shebang launchers \u001b[90m(14.437082ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.774758, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ known profiles exactly match Reader desktop paths, with no speculative library suffix \u001b[90m(5.246906ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.774803, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ discovery validates only the archive publication, with zero mutations or excluded file reads \u001b[90m(217.689526ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ absent, malformed, unavailable and unsupported standard paths are harmless \u001b[90m(99.100288ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.774895, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ standard source links and Analytics/source overlap are rejected before manifest reads \u001b[90m(120.331412ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ automatic discovery registers/captures once and recognizes manual profile/storage-root aliases \u001b[90m(1388.178009ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ removal is respected across restarts without Reader reads; explicit detection restores the source \u001b[90m(1305.060574ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.774983, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ discovery shows the standard Reader while preserving an existing custom source \u001b[90m(1098.238705ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.775183, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ startup discovery does not delay initialization/bootstrap while validation and capture run asynchronously \u001b[90m(529.20543ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[434.775223, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ automatic detection defers safely during another analysis and pending startup stops on close \u001b[90m(716.23177ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.55924, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ configured path aliases remain suppressed without probing and explicit registration clears both spellings \u001b[90m(784.349617ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572199, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ public Reader process remains open through capture, import/checkpoint races, conversion, clear/restore and restart \u001b[90m(2487.994007ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ default explicitly reproduces Reader 3.1.0's complete light and dark semantic palette \u001b[90m(2.276389ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.57227, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ modern explicitly reproduces Reader 3.1.0's complete light and dark semantic palette \u001b[90m(0.288074ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Modern adds presentation effects without introducing a different base color palette \u001b[90m(0.132901ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ current delivery has exactly eight artifacts without changing application version \u001b[90m(5.624774ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ download revisions preserve composite extensions and can address historical unsuffixed files \u001b[90m(0.789129ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ checksum tool names only seven current artifacts and leaves historical files untouched \u001b[90m(101.993498ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ all three current serializers preserve exact chart bins, cumulative denominators, contracts and versions \u001b[90m(36.300649ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ new private prompt/URL/filename/domain/language labels are neutral by default and explicit inclusion restores them \u001b[90m(20.702582ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ legacy-compatible mode explicitly omits Explorer additions and preserves supported old numerical tables \u001b[90m(4.345417ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ opt-in HTML evidence uses safe shared Markdown with literal archived HTML and zero loading attributes \u001b[90m(54.714508ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ CSV formula safety and table IDs also cover new exact chart data and hostile source strings \u001b[90m(2.152213ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572382, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unknown saved filter values remain internal and are explicitly unapplied rather than leaking nested wording \u001b[90m(11.106323ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ allowlisted Markdown supports headings, emphasis, lists, quotations, tables and code forms \u001b[90m(22.324005ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ copy payloads preserve original source, CRLF, final newline and unclosed fenced code \u001b[90m(2.726478ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ raw HTML, SVG, MathML, events and injected app commands remain text \u001b[90m(2.425274ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ links remain inert; unsafe schemes, credentials and URL controls cannot become actions \u001b[90m(2.152093ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ link labels and language metadata cannot inject command attributes \u001b[90m(2.173905ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ highlighted HTML is re-allowlisted and all installed grammars remain usable \u001b[90m(110.091483ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ large and deeply nested input has a bounded display while keeping source unchanged \u001b[90m(1.446861ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Date lookup clamps outside the plot and chooses the closest date in chart coordinates \u001b[90m(1.2483ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572578, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Client coordinates respect CSS scaling and both SVG letterbox directions \u001b[90m(0.335185ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572589, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ The 45-date and eight-series window retains exact original table row identities \u001b[90m(4.374721ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Missing and unavailable cells stay distinct from an observed zero \u001b[90m(14.609303ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572616, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Derived zeroes remain line vertices without points, while unavailable counts break the line \u001b[90m(10.4275ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Non-finite counts never become observed zeroes or evidence points \u001b[90m(1.162962ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Hover modes and active dates are independent for each chart \u001b[90m(0.30568ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572624, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Chart titles, series names, keys, and formatting cannot inject HTML or event handlers \u001b[90m(3.028753ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572665, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ 7z: capture reads only allowed files, emits no source mutations or excluded analytics \u001b[90m(243.865305ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ zip6: capture reads only allowed files, emits no source mutations or excluded analytics \u001b[90m(131.895732ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572675, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ reading-only pointer publication does not invalidate analytics identity \u001b[90m(102.797633ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ journal manager operations are replayed exactly and policy data are excluded \u001b[90m(164.127559ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572689, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ clear and delete operations maintain catalog revision semantics \u001b[90m(157.240413ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572699, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unknown journal operation or invalid checksum fails closed \u001b[90m(129.10058ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572715, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ generation replacement retries; missing/reclaimed members never produce partial results \u001b[90m(384.839204ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572785, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ advancing journal after selected boundary gives a complete explicitly stale snapshot \u001b[90m(172.522075ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancellation and disk-full failures clean only owned work and retain source bytes \u001b[90m(173.64813ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ source/output traversal, symlink and hard-link aliases are rejected before content reads \u001b[90m(95.448666ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ filesystem-read-only source still captures without an ownership lease \u001b[90m(145.073443ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ disconnected source continues to protect report destinations \u001b[90m(89.128737ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572917, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ unregistered Reader profile and renamed storage destinations are rejected using metadata only \u001b[90m(88.072482ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572927, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ storage keeps exact bytes and adds the requested binary-scaled example \u001b[90m(16.800808ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572959, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ decimal MB/GB threshold boundaries select binary KiB, MiB and GiB \u001b[90m(0.387694ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.572962, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ storage localizes exact counts and two decimal digits while keeping units adjacent \u001b[90m(0.618051ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573013, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ missing or invalid storage remains unavailable rather than a fabricated size \u001b[90m(0.134082ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ offline 1.0 migration uses complete owned text, exact identities and original producer \u001b[90m(950.199836ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ removed/cleared v2 captures never resurrect through legacy snapshot fallback \u001b[90m(493.68742ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ immutable capture history is disabled by default, bounded when enabled, active is protected \u001b[90m(186.151388ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573021, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ aborted capture publication and failed mutable publication preserve usable generations \u001b[90m(67.808212ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573027, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ owned mutable generation recovery and ownership checks do not follow external aliases \u001b[90m(74.740399ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573116, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Analytics service rejects a second writer and releases its owned lease \u001b[90m(92.727988ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573128, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ legacy snapshot fingerprint changes are detected without rewriting baseline bytes \u001b[90m(32.509262ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573131, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ corrupt active capture or pointer falls back to the protected prior complete capture \u001b[90m(60.950091ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573154, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ derived index version and base fingerprint force owned-text rebuild without a source \u001b[90m(392.018099ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ capture-pointer disk-full retains previous usable capture and leaves rollback baseline untouched \u001b[90m(61.685565ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573167, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ retained capture diff compares scoped recorded identities and capture provenance \u001b[90m(547.530973ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573181, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ derived-index disk-full retains usable computed metrics and full original capture \u001b[90m(56.308281ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ recycled writer PID does not strand a closed or crashed owned store \u001b[90m(63.053536ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573209, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Linux process-birth mismatch identifies an obsolete PID lease without accepting live concurrent writers \u001b[90m(52.276843ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ writer-lease disk-full cannot strand valid owned legacy state \u001b[90m(43.470598ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573275, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ independent process crash before lease publication leaves only safely recoverable owned staging \u001b[90m(97.369534ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573282, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ independent process crash at public lease rename leaves complete reclaimable lease \u001b[90m(145.069764ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573298, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ concurrent directory claims and stale reclamations publish exactly one complete live writer \u001b[90m(146.535636ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573305, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ failed directory lease publication preserves legacy bytes and removes only owned stage \u001b[90m(51.885534ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573326, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ prior valid live file lease is honored without publishing or deleting any new lock \u001b[90m(27.379286ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ an unleased reader cannot request recovery or remove another writer work \u001b[90m(28.496348ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.57334, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ wall-clock jumps cannot reclaim a live current-process lease without Linux birth data \u001b[90m(24.028083ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573348, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ EPERM during writer publication is busy only when another live lease is verified \u001b[90m(60.35148ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573421, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ EPERM during writer retirement is busy only when another live lease is verified \u001b[90m(110.181432ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573429, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ EPERM during writer publication-after-gap is busy only when another live lease is verified \u001b[90m(53.341121ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573438, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ writer publication preserves EPERM when the public lease is absent \u001b[90m(12.357838ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573459, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ writer publication preserves EPERM when the public lease is stale \u001b[90m(73.269099ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ writer publication preserves EPERM when the public lease is malformed \u001b[90m(18.986669ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573466, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ writer publication preserves EPERM when the public lease is extra-member \u001b[90m(17.932045ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573483, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ writer publication preserves EPERM when the public lease is unreadable \u001b[90m(17.52943ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573562, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Analytics dictionaries contain every literal UI translation in all five locales \u001b[90m(11.138052ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573569, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Static appearance catalogs keep 17 interface and 10 independent code themes with light/dark palettes \u001b[90m(0.543869ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573591, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Preview synthetic mixed collection totals add only compatible record units \u001b[90m(86.788528ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Compact GUI report retains exact numerical tables and keeps evidence references in worker only \u001b[90m(67.934121ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573652, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ full replacement retains independent pane axes, open details, drafts, caret and focus in order \u001b[90m(5.820039ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573667, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ changed workspace context never receives old positions, private-evidence opt-in or input drafts \u001b[90m(0.695137ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573685, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ semantic opener identity survives inserted siblings; vanished named controls are not replaced by index \u001b[90m(0.415186ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573716, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ drafts:false preserves geometry and focus without reviving an explicit form reset or toolbar selection \u001b[90m(1.875356ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.573724, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ multiple selects and same-name radio/check values preserve their distinct choices \u001b[90m(2.189984ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574163, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ tests 316\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574238, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574287, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ pass 316\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574294, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574305, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574353, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574361, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[435.574372, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 7251.838371\u001b[39m\r\n"]
