[666.575721, "m", "Alternative — tests and packages"]
[666.825875, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ renderer network allowlist admits only credential-free HTTP(S) images \u001b[90m(1.537897ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ remote image headers strip ambient credentials, referrer and response cookies without mutating inputs \u001b[90m(1.268951ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.954264, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ raw assistant and reasoning JSON uses readable two-space indentation \u001b[90m(2.707869ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.955121, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ formatting preserves duplicate keys, exact numbers, escape spelling and key order \u001b[90m(0.396998ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.956031, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ conservative repair removes trailing commas and escapes only literal string controls \u001b[90m(1.431326ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.956129, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ uncertain or truncated JSON stays visible without guessing missing data \u001b[90m(0.287914ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.956413, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ mixed prose, Markdown and fenced or indented code keep their established rendering \u001b[90m(0.448816ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.95651, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ does not format user/tool/system messages or mutate source data and source identity \u001b[90m(0.480764ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.956822, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preserves empty-thought suppression without hiding substantive or unfamiliar JSON \u001b[90m(0.742869ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.957246, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ source-size, nesting and output-expansion bounds fall back without throwing \u001b[90m(100.618313ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.98085, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ hides only empty ChatGPT thoughts bodies, including Alternative reasoning roles \u001b[90m(2.215487ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.980984, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preserves substantive, mixed, unknown, malformed and oversize responses \u001b[90m(9.561983ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.9811, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ preserves user/tool/system messages and fenced or indented literal JSON examples \u001b[90m(0.410338ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ display filtering preserves original IDs, source indexes and source bytes \u001b[90m(12.348901ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ result filtering uses complete source text, keeps useful JSON and never guesses from a marker \u001b[90m(0.433423ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ mixed-role and duplicate source indexes do not conceal visible companion messages \u001b[90m(1.811188ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ browser and CommonJS helper use the same predicate \u001b[90m(2.835111ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981264, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ server URLs retain prefixes and reject credential-bearing or non-HTTP addresses \u001b[90m(2.064039ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ browse and collections preserve multi-conversation identities and exact pagination \u001b[90m(15.928362ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981344, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ thread uses complete identity and retains raw turns with normalized messages \u001b[90m(1.30763ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a mismatched thread identity is never opened under the selected title \u001b[90m(1.518137ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ extension search traverses every page with exact totals and stable passage identities \u001b[90m(11.263696ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ changing page size and jumping offsets stays in the original extension snapshot \u001b[90m(11.63852ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a short complete snapshot can be repaged without querying a new snapshot \u001b[90m(3.316045ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.98137, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ expired remote snapshots surface a restart requirement and clear local session state \u001b[90m(7.178002ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ stock search is explicitly bounded, uses one top-50 request, and never invents exhaustive totals \u001b[90m(2.74861ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981697, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ authentication and capability errors are not disguised as absent extensions \u001b[90m(0.867717ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ stats preserves counts and units and checks the selected scope \u001b[90m(1.268431ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid input fails before network access \u001b[90m(0.735177ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ redirects are blocked and fetch credentials are omitted \u001b[90m(4.629113ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ timeouts and cancellation produce distinct structured errors \u001b[90m(16.287404ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ oversized declared and streamed responses are rejected \u001b[90m(3.118928ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ HTTP status survives invalid JSON so missing optional routes can be recognized \u001b[90m(0.476628ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Alternative profile writes remain isolated from sibling Reader files \u001b[90m(3.798161ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ invalid preferences are constrained, corruption is preserved on load \u001b[90m(1.160387ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ persisted settings retain scoped pins, searches and reading position \u001b[90m(2.377752ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ corrupt saved settings block autosave and close-flush writes until explicit closed-profile recovery \u001b[90m(2.215136ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ oversized saved settings remain byte-exact when a default-state flush is attempted \u001b[90m(17.787723ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ image preference upgrades existing profiles without changing their identity or saved records \u001b[90m(3.953825ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Windows mixed special-character paths accept only equivalent decoded spelling \u001b[90m(3.702317ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Windows literal percent-encoded-looking filename is decoded exactly once \u001b[90m(0.374053ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ POSIX mixed special-character paths accept only equivalent decoded spelling \u001b[90m(0.492031ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981708, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ POSIX literal percent-encoded-looking filename is decoded exactly once \u001b[90m(0.269055ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981714, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Windows UNC entry requires the same host, share and exact path \u001b[90m(0.620875ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981767, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ malformed escaping and malformed expected paths fail closed on both platforms \u001b[90m(0.688407ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ preserves literal backslashes in POSIX filenames without accepting native separators \u001b[90m(0.430348ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ equivalent special-path encoding still requires the owning main frame \u001b[90m(0.417649ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.981795, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Alternative native Windows entry accepts equivalent Chromium percent-encoding without case/path relaxation \u001b[90m(3.122863ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ Alternative rejects foreign URLs, hosts, query/fragment suffixes and encoded separators \u001b[90m(0.392471ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.982806, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Alternative IPC requires the exact owning WebContents and actual main frame even with equivalent entry encoding \u001b[90m(0.30527ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.982842, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ Alternative POSIX file entries preserve case and literal percent signs without accepting fragments \u001b[90m(0.360863ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[666.983499, "o", "\u001b[34mℹ tests 51\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 51\u001b[39m\r\n"]
